,"units":"Per cent","pts":[[1535760000,9.6],[1541030400,9.6],[1543622400,8.6],[1551398400,8.3],[1556668800,8.4],[1561939200,8.3],[1567296000,8.6],[1572566400,9.7],[1577836800,9.3],[1583020800,9.1],[1588291200,9.7],[1593561600,9.8],[1598918400,9.9],[1604188800,9.8],[1609459200,9.7],[1614556800,10.0],[1619827200,10.7],[1625097600,11.0],[1630454400,10.8],[1635724800,11.5],[1640995200,10.7],[1646092800,10.9],[1651363200,11.1],[1656633600,10.3],[1661990400,11.1],[1667260800,10.8],[1672531200,10.8],[1677628800,10.4],[1682899200,10.2],[1688169600,10.0],[1693526400,9.3],[1698796800,9.6],[1704067200,9.6],[1709251200,9.5],[1714521600,9.6],[1719792000,9.8],[1725148800,9.6],[1730419200,9.7],[1735689600,9.9],[1740787200,9.4],[1746057600,9.4],[1751328000,8.7],[1756684800,8.8],[1761955200,8.1],[1767225600,8.9],[1772323200,9.1],[1777593600,9.2],[1782864000,9.3],[1788220800,9.7]]}]}],"qna":[{"question":"What is this survey?","answer":"A Reserve Bank survey that asks households for a number: how much did prices rise over the last year (perception) and by how much will they rise over the next three months and the next year (expectations). Quantitative responses are summarised by their mean and median, with standard errors in the press release.^It is a household-sentiment gauge, not a forecast by the Reserve Bank, and reflects respondents' own consumption baskets."},{"question":"How should I read it?","answer":"Medians are the headline the Reserve Bank quotes. Households typically report inflation well above measured CPI, so the level matters less than the change between rounds and the gap between three-month and one-year expectations.^Rising expectations feed wage and price setting and can pre-empt tightening of policy; falling expectations are consistent with disinflation."},{"question":"What are the caveats?","answer":"The survey covers urban households in major cities (13 cities earlier, 19 now), so it under-represents rural India. The series starts in September 2018 here because earlier press releases used a different table layout.^Each point comes from Table 3 of the press release for that round, as first published."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:13:38+00:00"}